<title>UK: Burford pretax profit up to 15.05 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Burford pretax profit up to 15.05 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		   3.30		vs    2.77</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	    1.15		vs    1.10</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)    2.10		vs    1.80</p>
<p> Pretax			 15.05		vs   11.16</p>
<p> Turnover		     32.93		vs   26.52</p>
<p>NOTE - The net asset value of Burford rose to 110.1 pence per share from 101.5 in the previous year.</p>
<p>Full company name - Burford Holdings Plc</p>
</text>
